1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,643
Suffixes decide the part of speech.

2
00:00:02,643 --> 00:00:07,734
Ment, ion, ity, ness, ance and ship make nouns.

3
00:00:07,734 --> 00:00:11,627
Er, or, ist and ian make a person.

4
00:00:11,627 --> 00:00:14,674
Ise, fy and en make verbs.

5
00:00:14,674 --> 00:00:19,283
Ful, less, ous, al, ive and able make adjectives.

6
00:00:19,283 --> 00:00:21,145
And ly makes an adverb.

